abstract: >
  Source code accompanying a controlled comparison of six temporal
  modeling architectures for ECG-based obstructive sleep apnea detection.
  The software implements a dual-branch convolutional framework with
  Efficient Channel Attention and six temporal modeling variants:
  Transformer, Mamba, GRU, LSTM, BiGRU, and BiLSTM.
  It also includes training configurations, model evaluation,
  and Integrated Gradients explainability analysis.

keywords:
  - obstructive sleep apnea
  - ECG
  - deep learning
  - Transformer
  - Mamba
  - GRU
  - LSTM
  - Integrated Gradients
  - explainable artificial intelligence
  - PhysioNet Apnea-ECG
